      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3><ul><li><code>.notchext</code> packages: one file that opens NotchNotch's install review on double-click, or with <b>+</b>. Make one with <code>notchnotch pack</code> or <code>notchnotch build --pack</code>; new projects get <code>npm run pack</code>. The app unpacks them with its own validating extractor and keeps the download's quarantine flag on the unpacked files.</li></ul>]]></description>
